soma check app.cell → ✓ ; soma run --fresh app.cell → "MID a", never "DEEP a". Deep (interior of Mid, itself interior of Desk) handles ping, which only Mid emits; by the one rule an interior cell's event reaches its siblings and its parent, not its own interior, so Deep.ping never runs. At depth 1 the same program is refused (E0014 "no sibling emits it"); signals.rs:58-61 (check_interior) counts every emit of the parent as reaching the children, whether the parent is top-level or interior.
